	"\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @
	"\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
	"\n\n<f1>This map was created to humiliate Vip3r. For those of you that do not know the
         \n history of vip3r heres a rough summary, A little douchebag named Vip3r got his Hands
	 \n On a crash pack. The script kiddy he is he bagan to crash all the servers all the time.
	 \n it got to a  point where everyone was starting to give in and agree to play where and 
         \n when vip3r allowed them to, in the server he wanted them to. the then distributed the 
         \n crash pack to other script kiddys who made a clan with him that did nothing but crash 
         \n annihilation server. After the crash pack was subverted by a fix, Vip3r claimed he was
         \n a hacker and could crash my server if he wanted to. but didnt want to.. I was very
         \n confident at the time in my servers crash protection and taunted him to proove it.
         \n I made and hosted his map as a way to taunt him to crash my server. I even told him
         \n i would remove the map if he could crash my server. Vip3r swore he could crash the server
         \n He never did manage to crash the server ever again. He did however beg to have map
         /n renamed or removed.  that never happened either..........Bong ";